..!interpreter english translate noabbrev
..!meta M|=dfue/FORECASTCONFIG
..*****************************************************************************
.. Name           : FORECASTCONFIG.SE
.. Author         : mh
.. Verantwortlich : mh
.. Kontrolle      :
.. Functionality  :
...Includes
